  "term": "vegetative",
  "definition": "In this context, vegetative refers to a cluster of symptoms that can form part of a depressive episode. These symptoms are described as especially prominent in melancholia and are discussed alongside psychomotor retardation as a distinct symptom profile that may relate to altered GABA function.",
